        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "a. All managerial, supervisory, and confidential employees as defined by the Higher Education Employer-Employee Relations Act are excluded. Employees who hold any managerial, supervisory, or confidential appointment, regardless of the percentage of time worked in such appointment, are excluded.",
