        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "7. With the exception of Section G. below, the expedited arbitration procedure referenced herein shall be the sole and exclusive procedure through which the parties shall resolve disputes between them as to the inclusion or exclusion of employees in or from the bargaining unit. This procedure shall be used after discussions between the parties have failed to achieve resolution of such matters.",
